  "details": "A simple feature that makes a group:\n\n- Hide in a user group list (or go in a blocked group section)\n\n- Unable to invite you in the group, or a group instance\n\n- Hides all the group public instances\n\n- Shows a warning when joining friends in a blocked group instance\n\nAs simple as that, would help with \"people\" going round in a specific world instance inviting everyone to a specific group, or inviting to a specific group instance\n\nThanks a lot",
